WEBVTT

01:56.324 --> 01:57.992
THE BEGINNING

02:38.825 --> 02:42.787
MY SECRET PLAN

03:04.976 --> 03:07.937
IT SEEMS THEY'RE TALKING ABOUT ME
DOWNSTAIRS. I'M CURIOUS.

03:13.985 --> 03:15.945
IS IT TIME TO EAT? GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:16.988 --> 03:18.740
IS IT TIME TO EAT?

03:20.992 --> 03:23.661
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:23.786 --> 03:26.206
IS IT TIME TO EAT?

03:32.503 --> 03:35.715
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:36.841 --> 03:39.219
IS THE FOOD NOT READY YET?

03:40.345 --> 03:42.222
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:46.267 --> 03:48.728
IT'S ABOUT TIME FOR MY PATROL.

04:01.783 --> 04:03.243
LET'S START WITH THIS ROOM.

04:04.786 --> 04:05.995
ALL CLEAR.

04:07.038 --> 04:08.248
LET'S GO TO THE NEXT ROOM.

04:09.290 --> 04:12.001
HUH? WHO'S CALLING FOR ME?

04:15.004 --> 04:17.006
TH-THAT...

04:19.175 --> 04:21.010
TH-THAT SMELLS OF DEATH!

04:24.931 --> 04:27.350
OH, THAT WAS VERY UNPLEASANT.

04:28.434 --> 04:29.269
Hm?

04:29.686 --> 04:32.146
WHAT ARE YOU ALL DOING?

04:37.568 --> 04:40.029
IT SMELLS A BIT OF DEATH AGAIN...

04:52.333 --> 04:55.420
MY CROTCH IS SUDDENLY ITCHY.

05:06.973 --> 05:08.933
I-IT REEKS OF DEATH!

06:00.360 --> 06:02.070
EEK! YOU AGAIN?!

08:32.428 --> 08:33.638
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:34.430 --> 08:36.390
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN?

08:37.934 --> 08:39.644
LET'S PLAY SOME MORE.

08:41.437 --> 08:42.271
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:42.813 --> 08:43.773
PUNCH! PUNCH!

08:44.815 --> 08:46.651
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN...?

08:46.943 --> 08:48.903
THIS WILL MAKE YOU FEEL BETTER.

08:50.446 --> 08:51.280
ANOTHER PUN--

08:51.364 --> 08:53.282
EEK! YOU AGAIN?!

08:55.952 --> 08:57.787
WHAT ARE YOU DOING? STOP IT!

08:59.121 --> 09:00.831
I-I'M SCARED!

09:13.052 --> 09:14.762
EBISU

09:29.569 --> 09:31.779
HEY LADY, ARE YOU SLEEPING?

09:33.072 --> 09:35.533
WE PROMISED THAT YOU'LL ALWAYS GIVE ME
A SNACK AT THIS TIME.

09:35.825 --> 09:39.620
WAKE UP, LADY! IT'S TIME FOR MY SNACK!

09:46.168 --> 09:47.878
NOW, GIVE ME A SNACK.

11:30.272 --> 11:33.734
TERMITE EXTERMINATION

13:05.451 --> 13:09.246
CROSS-EYE EXPEDITION

14:59.148 --> 15:00.983
BIG BANDAGE MASK SAFE AND SECURE

22:51.912 --> 22:53.955
DEFORMED REUNION

26:41.641 --> 26:42.976
THE END
